# (main after #249: rows have no --- markers) JAWS: Home > NBA > --- News Headlines --- > Enter (league NewsDialog) > Escape > Alt+Tab away and back >
# Escape to home > Alt+Tab away and back. The stray text is the closed dialog's label,
# "Press Enter or double-click a headline to open in your browser:" (scores.py NewsDialog).
# Notepad is open behind the app, so Alt+Tab goes to it and back.
w 0.5
t NBA
w 3
k {ENTER}
w 14
t News
w 4
e News Headlines
k {ENTER}
w 6
e News Headlines List
k {ESC}
w 6
e! double-click a headline
k %{TAB}
w 5
e Notepad
k %{TAB}
w 7
e! double-click a headline
k {ESC}
w 7
e! double-click a headline
k %{TAB}
w 5
k %{TAB}
w 7
e! double-click a headline
